SUMMARY:Downtown After 5
DESCRIPTION:April 17 – Stomp & Holler Night\nSam Burchfield with the Hillclimbers and Friends\nNonprofit Partner: RemixIT Asheville\n\n\n May 15 – Latin Dance Night\nLa Sonora Carolina featuring Ulisse Rotoli on flamenco guitar\nNonprofit Partner: Food Connection\n\n\n June 19 – Juneteenth Celebration\nKanika Moore\nwith Reggie Headen and the Nite Time Noon\nNonprofit Partner: MLK Jr. Association\n\n\n August 21 – New Orleans Night\nJ & The Causeways\nplus Bayou Diesel with a special appearance from the Asheville Second Line\nNonprofit Partner: Asheville Mardi Gras\n\n\nAll shows are free and open to the public in Pack Square Park.\n\n\nGrab your friends\, support local nonprofits\, and get ready to dance in Downtown Asheville all summer long.
